msgid "90 days"
msgstr "90 dni"

#: src/copy/status.ts
msgid "A check sets a component's state without anyone's hand, and Yuva tells your team when it goes down or up."
msgstr "Preverjanje nastavi stanje komponente brez človeškega posega, Yuva pa obvesti vašo ekipo, ko komponenta odpove ali se povrne."

#: src/copy/home.ts
msgid "a contact and their data"
msgstr "stik in njegovi podatki"

#: src/copy/home.ts
msgid "A conversation in the {platform} SDK: a question about an order and the team's replies with a tracking link, and a box to write back."
msgstr "Pogovor v SDK-ju za {platform}: vprašanje o naročilu in odgovori ekipe s povezavo za sledenje ter polje za odgovor."

#: src/copy/status.ts
msgid "A customer can dismiss it. It returns when the incident gets a new update."
msgstr "Stranka jo lahko opusti. Vrne se, ko incident prejme novo posodobitev."

#: src/copy/cloudflare-email.ts
msgid "A customer writes to one of your support addresses, for example support@example.com."
msgstr "Stranka piše na enega od vaših naslovov za podporo, na primer support@example.com."

#: src/copy/home.ts
msgid "A finished import in the panel: 6 conversations and 12 messages copied from an mbox file, with a note that Yuva has no access to your mailbox."
msgstr "Končan uvoz v nadzorni plošči: 6 pogovorov in 12 sporočil, kopiranih iz datoteke mbox, z opombo, da Yuva nima dostopa do vašega poštnega predala."

#: src/copy/status.ts
msgid "A footer band: a coloured square and the state in words, a strip of 90 days with the uptime, and Status by Yuva."
msgstr "Pas v nogi strani: barvni kvadrat in stanje z besedami, trak 90 dni z razpoložljivostjo in Status by Yuva."

#: src/copy/contact.ts
msgid "A hosted service and commercial licenses"
msgstr "Gostovana storitev in komercialne licence"

#: src/copy/cloudflare-email.ts
msgid "A message can be up to 25 MiB including attachments, which is the Cloudflare Email Routing limit. Yuva keeps up to 50 attachments per message, each within the server's attachment size limit (25 MiB by default) and allowed types; it leaves out the rest."
msgstr "Sporočilo je lahko skupaj s prilogami veliko do 25 MiB, kar je omejitev Cloudflare Email Routing. Yuva obdrži do 50 prilog na sporočilo, vsako v okviru strežnikove omejitve velikosti prilog (privzeto 25 MiB) in dovoljenih vrst; preostale izpusti."

#: src/copy/status.ts
msgid "A notice waits 60 seconds so you can undo it, and notices about one incident keep their distance, so a long outage does not flood inboxes."
msgstr "Obvestilo počaka 60 sekund, da ga lahko prekličete, obvestila o istem incidentu pa držijo razmik, da dolg izpad ne preplavi nabiralnikov."

#: src/copy/status.ts
msgid "A page stays private until you publish it, and your team previews it in the panel before that."
msgstr "Stran je zasebna, dokler je ne objavite, vaša ekipa pa si jo prej ogleda v predogledu v plošči."

#: src/copy/home.ts
msgid "a personal one is private, even from admins"
msgstr "osebni je zaseben, tudi pred skrbniki"

#: src/copy/shadcn.ts
msgid "A project that already uses shadcn/ui, with React and Tailwind CSS."
msgstr "Projekt, ki že uporablja shadcn/ui, z Reactom in Tailwind CSS."

#: src/copy/home.ts
msgid "A public page for the state of your products, kept in the same inbox as your support. Checks keep it current and subscribers hear by e-mail."
msgstr "Javna stran s stanjem vaših izdelkov, v istem nabiralniku kot vaša podpora. Preverjanja jo ohranjajo posodobljeno, naročniki pa izvejo po e-pošti."

#: src/copy/status.ts
msgid "A public status page with components, incidents, maintenance and history, kept current by checks and by your team. E-mail subscribers, a line in the chat widget and the apps, and one reply to everyone who wrote."
msgstr "Javna statusna stran s komponentami, incidenti, vzdrževanjem in zgodovino, ki jo posodabljajo preverjanja in vaša ekipa. Naročniki po e-pošti, vrstica v pogovornem gradniku in aplikacijah ter en odgovor vsem, ki so pisali."

#: src/copy/status.ts
msgid "A sample status page: the overall state, an open incident and four components with their last 90 days as coloured bars."
msgstr "Vzorčna statusna stran: splošno stanje, odprt incident in štiri komponente z zadnjimi 90 dnevi kot barvnimi stolpci."

#: src/copy/cloudflare-email.ts
msgid "A small open-source Worker"
msgstr "Majhen odprtokodni Worker"

#: src/copy/shadcn.ts
msgid "A Yuva chat channel and its public key (yuva_pk_…)."
msgstr "Klepetalni kanal Yuva in njegov javni ključ (yuva_pk_…)."

#: src/copy/status.ts
msgid "A Yuva status page shows whether your product works. It sits in your support inbox, so your chat widget and apps show an open incident, and one reply answers everyone who wrote about it."
msgstr "Yuvina statusna stran kaže, ali vaš izdelek deluje. Živi v vašem nabiralniku podpore, zato pogovorni gradnik in aplikacije prikažejo odprt incident, en odgovor pa doseže vse, ki so pisali o njem."

#: src/copy/home.ts
msgid "Accepted answer"
msgstr "Sprejet odgovor"

#: src/copy/shadcn.ts
msgid "Add every origin that will show the components as an allowed origin: your site and your development server."
msgstr "Dodajte vsak origin, ki bo prikazoval komponente, kot dovoljen: svoje spletno mesto in razvojni strežnik."

#: src/copy/status.ts
msgid "Add it for a second row with each component's state."
msgstr "Dodajte ga za drugo vrstico s stanjem vsake komponente."

#: src/copy/home.ts
msgid "Add ratings and a discussion area to your own documentation pages."
msgstr "Dodajte ocene in prostor za razprave na svoje strani z dokumentacijo."

