#: src/copy/status.ts
msgid "When a check goes down, Yuva can open a draft incident for you to review, publish one at once, or open none. When it recovers, Yuva resolves what it opened."
msgstr "Ko preverjanje odpove, lahko Yuva odpre osnutek incidenta v vaš pregled, takoj objavi incident ali ne odpre nobenega. Ko se povrne, Yuva reši, kar je odprla."

