#: src/copy/cloudflare-email.ts
msgid "With FALLBACK_FORWARD set, the message is forwarded to that address instead. Without it the delivery fails and the sending server may retry. Messages that Yuva refuses on purpose, such as mail to an unknown address, are rejected, not forwarded."
msgstr "Ko je nastavljen FALLBACK_FORWARD, se sporočilo namesto tega posreduje na ta naslov. Brez njega dostava spodleti, pošiljateljev strežnik pa lahko poskusi znova. Sporočila, ki jih Yuva zavrne namerno, na primer pošta na neznan naslov, so zavrnjena in ne posredovana."

#: src/copy/home.ts
