#: src/copy/status.ts
msgid "Write one reply. Review shows how many conversations get it, and you can close each one afterwards."
msgstr "Napišite en odgovor. Pregled pokaže, koliko pogovorov ga prejme, nato pa lahko vsakega zaprete."

#: src/copy/contact.ts
msgid "Write to the Yuva team about investment, partnerships, commercial licenses or press, or find the right place for questions and security reports."
msgstr "Pišite ekipi Yuva o vlaganju, partnerstvih, komercialnih licencah ali tisku ali poiščite pravo mesto za vprašanja in varnostne prijave."

#: src/copy/cloudflare-email.ts
msgid "Yes, when you set YUVA_INGRESS_AUTHSERV_ID to mx.cloudflare.net. Yuva then reads the DMARC verdict that Email Routing adds. A new conversation that fails DMARC is marked as spam."
msgstr "Da, ko nastavite YUVA_INGRESS_AUTHSERV_ID na mx.cloudflare.net. Yuva nato prebere razsodbo DMARC, ki jo doda Email Routing. Nov pogovor, ki ne prestane DMARC, se označi kot neželena pošta."

#: src/copy/status.ts
msgid "You choose how many failures in a row count, and a state your team set by hand is never overridden by a check."
msgstr "Vi izberete, koliko zaporednih napak šteje, stanja, ki ga je vaša ekipa nastavila ročno, pa preverjanje nikoli ne povozi."

#: src/copy/brand.ts
msgid "You may"
msgstr "Smete"

#: src/copy/cloudflare-email.ts
msgid "You need a Yuva server and a Cloudflare account that manages the domain."
msgstr "Potrebujete strežnik Yuva in račun Cloudflare, ki upravlja domeno."

#: src/copy/ai.ts
msgid "You stay in charge"
msgstr "Vi imate nadzor"

#: src/copy/ai.ts
msgid "Your browser opens Yuva. Sign in with a one-time code; a new e-mail address gets a new account."
msgstr "Brskalnik odpre Yuvo. Prijavite se z enkratno kodo; nov e-poštni naslov dobi nov račun."

#: src/copy/ai.ts
msgid "Your code stays on your machine. Yuva only sees what the assistant creates through it."
msgstr "Vaša koda ostane na vašem računalniku. Yuva vidi le tisto, kar pomočnik ustvari prek nje."

#: src/copy/status.ts
msgid "Your cron job or server calls a URL on a schedule. When the calls stop, the component goes down."
msgstr "Vaše opravilo cron ali strežnik kliče URL po urniku. Ko klici prenehajo, komponenta odpove."

#: src/copy/status.ts
msgid "Your logo and accent colour. The page speaks English, Turkish and German; visitors see times in their own time zone."
msgstr "Vaš logotip in barva poudarka. Stran govori angleško, turško in nemško; obiskovalci vidijo čase v svojem časovnem pasu."

#: src/copy/status.ts
msgid "Your look and language"
msgstr "Vaš videz in jezik"

#: src/copy/status.ts
msgid "Your own domain"
msgstr "Vaša lastna domena"

#: src/copy/cloudflare-email.ts
msgid "Your team answers in the panel. The reply is sent through the e-mail channel's own SMTP account, such as Amazon SES, Postmark or your own relay, from the same address and in the same thread. Replies do not go through the Worker."
msgstr "Vaša ekipa odgovarja v nadzorni plošči. Odgovor se pošlje prek lastnega računa SMTP e-poštnega kanala, na primer Amazon SES, Postmark ali vašega releja, z istega naslova in v isti niti. Odgovori ne gredo prek Workerja."

#: src/copy/status.ts
msgid "Your word first"
msgstr "Najprej vaša beseda"

#: src/copy/ai.ts
msgid "Your Yuva server"
msgstr "Vaš strežnik Yuva"

#: src/copy/ai.ts
msgid "Yuva and your AI assistant"
msgstr "Yuva in vaš pomočnik z umetno inteligenco"

#: src/copy/pages.ts
