msgstr "Gradivo znamke Yuva: logotip, barve in ime"

#: src/copy/docs.ts
msgid "Yuva brings e-mail, live chat and in-app messages from your customers into one inbox for your team. Start with Get started; every guide is listed below."
msgstr "Yuva zbere e-pošto, klepet v živo in sporočila v aplikaciji vaših strank v enem nabiralniku za vašo ekipo. Začnite z razdelkom Začnite; vsi vodniki so navedeni spodaj."

#: src/copy/home.ts
msgid "Yuva brings support e-mail, live chat and in-app conversations from all of your products into one shared inbox, and adds newsletters, mail migration and cookieless analytics. Open source, self-hosted, one Go binary with Postgres."
msgstr "Yuva zbere e-pošto za podporo, klepet v živo in pogovore v aplikaciji iz vseh vaših izdelkov v enem skupnem nabiralniku ter doda novičnike, prenos pošte in analitiko brez piškotkov. Odprta koda, lastno gostovanje, ena binarna datoteka v Go s Postgresom."

#: src/copy/cloudflare-email.ts
msgid "Yuva checks the signature and that the timestamp is within 5 minutes before it reads the message. A request with a wrong signature is refused."
msgstr "Yuva pred branjem sporočila preveri podpis in da je časovni žig v 5 minutah. Zahteva z napačnim podpisom je zavrnjena."

#: src/copy/ai.ts
msgid "Yuva cloud"
msgstr "Oblak Yuva"

#: src/copy/docs.ts
msgid "Yuva documentation"
msgstr "Dokumentacija Yuve"

#: src/copy/cloudflare-email.ts
msgid "Yuva Email Worker for Cloudflare"
msgstr "Yuva Email Worker za Cloudflare"

#: src/copy/cloudflare-email.ts
msgid "Yuva finds the e-mail channel for the recipient address and threads the message by In-Reply-To and References into the conversation it belongs to. Anything else starts a new conversation. A reply reopens the conversation."
msgstr "Yuva poišče e-poštni kanal za naslov prejemnika in sporočilo po In-Reply-To in References uvrsti v pogovor, kamor spada. Vse drugo začne nov pogovor. Odgovor pogovor znova odpre."

#: src/copy/shadcn.ts
msgid "Yuva for shadcn/ui"
msgstr "Yuva za shadcn/ui"

#: src/copy/ai.ts
msgid "Yuva has a built-in MCP server. Connect it once, and your assistant reads your project, sees what your workspace already has, and sets up live chat, analytics or newsletters, asking before each change."
msgstr "Yuva ima vgrajen strežnik MCP. Povežite ga enkrat, pa vaš pomočnik prebere vaš projekt, vidi, kaj vaš delovni prostor že ima, in nastavi klepet v živo, analitiko ali novičnike ter vpraša pred vsako spremembo."

#: src/copy/header.ts
msgid "Yuva home"
msgstr "Domov Yuva"

#: src/copy/ai.ts
msgid "Yuva in your AI assistant"
msgstr "Yuva v vašem pomočniku z umetno inteligenco"

#: src/copy/contact.ts
msgid "Yuva is in beta. Every release, the roadmap and the code are public, so you can see exactly where it stands."
msgstr "Yuva je v beti. Vsaka izdaja, načrt razvoja in koda so javni, tako da vidite, kje natančno je."

#: src/layouts/Footer.astro
msgid "Yuva on X"
msgstr "Yuva na X"

#: src/copy/status.ts
msgid "Yuva opens a connection to a host and port and checks that it answers."
msgstr "Yuva odpre povezavo z gostiteljem in vrati ter preveri, ali odgovarja."

#: src/copy/brand.ts
msgid "Yuva orange"
msgstr "Oranžna Yuva"

#: src/copy/home.ts
msgid "Yuva puts e-mail, live chat and in-app messages from all of your products into one inbox for your team. Open source, one Go binary with Postgres."
msgstr "Yuva zbere e-pošto, klepet v živo in sporočila v aplikaciji vseh vaših izdelkov v enem nabiralniku za vašo ekipo. Odprta koda, ena binarna datoteka v Go s Postgresom."

#: src/copy/cloudflare-email.ts
msgid "Yuva refuses any request without a valid HMAC signature or with a timestamp more than 5 minutes off, before it reads the body. Keep the secret to yourself."
msgstr "Yuva zavrne vsako zahtevo brez veljavnega podpisa HMAC ali s časovnim žigom, ki odstopa za več kot 5 minut, preden prebere telo. Skrivnost obdržite zase."

#: src/copy/pages.ts
msgid "Yuva releases"
msgstr "Izdaje Yuve"

#: src/copy/status.ts
msgid "Yuva renders it as plain HTML, complete without JavaScript, and answers are cached for 30 seconds so a CDN in front of your server can carry an outage's traffic."
msgstr "Yuva jo upodobi kot navaden HTML, popoln tudi brez JavaScripta, odgovori pa se 30 sekund hranijo v predpomnilniku, da CDN pred vašim strežnikom prenese promet med izpadom."

#: src/copy/status.ts
msgid "Yuva requests a URL on an interval and checks the status code, optionally a keyword and the certificate's expiry."
msgstr "Yuva v presledkih zahteva URL in preveri statusno kodo, po želji ključno besedo in potek certifikata."

#: src/copy/status.ts
msgid "Yuva sends it as you to every linked conversation that is still open, through each one's own channel. It cannot be recalled once sent."
msgstr "Yuva jo pošlje v vašem imenu vsakemu povezanemu pogovoru, ki je še odprt, po kanalu vsakega od njih. Ko je poslana, je ni mogoče preklicati."

#: src/copy/docs.ts
msgid "Yuva signs every request with Standard Webhooks and retries failed deliveries. Registering an endpoint and verifying a signature are in the webhooks guide."
msgstr "Yuva vsako zahtevo podpiše s Standard Webhooks in ponovi neuspele dostave. Registracija končne točke in preverjanje podpisa sta v vodniku za webhooke."

